// REJECTS: Unexpected token '~primaryKey'. Valid alternatives: ['~func', '~src']
//
// A relation function mapping is `relationSource primaryKey? propertyMappings`. The source
// clause is REQUIRED and it must come first; ~primaryKey may only follow it.
//
// Contrast the relational class mapping in the same file format, where ~primaryKey PRECEDES
// ~mainTable. Two mapping kinds, both with a "which table/relation" clause and a
// "~primaryKey" clause, and the two clauses are ordered oppositely. A rewrite that
// generalises one to the other is more permissive in one and stricter in the other.
###Mapping
Mapping fixture::neg::RelationPkFirst
(
   fixture::neg::Person: Relation
   {
      ~primaryKey: id
      ~func fixture::neg::personRelation():Relation<Any>[1]
      firstName: FIRST_NAME
   }
)
